# sweep: --bare
# The specimens that answer a tap, each checked for the answer it gives, and
# every way out of the worked download. The main route walks the pages; this
# one presses things on them.
wait-for Type and tone
# An enabled button says it was pressed; a disabled one stays silent.
tap Input
wait-for Groups, fields and asking
tap Buttons
tap-id button-primary
wait-for You pressed Download.
tap Keep both
wait-for You pressed Keep both.
tap Nothing to save
expect You pressed Keep both.
clean
shot gallery-pressed
# The segments and the stepper hold one value, and the stepper stops at its
# ends.
tap-paged Medium
wait-for Brightness 1
tap-id step-more
wait-for Brightness 2
tap Small
wait-for Brightness 0
# The sort chip opens its menu, and choosing an order closes it.
tap Sort: Newest
wait-for Title
tap Title
wait-for Sort: Title
tap Keep awake
clean
shot gallery-settings
tap-paged Night light
clean
shot gallery-switches
# The confirmation over the Fields page keeps the shelf on Keep it.
tap Fields
wait-for Search the catalogue
tap Delete this shelf
wait-for Delete this shelf?
expect The books stay on the device.
clean
shot gallery-confirm
tap Keep it
expect-missing Delete this shelf?
# A filing choice is marked, and Something else raises the keyboard.
tap-paged Archive
wait-for How should this note be filed?
tap Something else
wait-for-id kb.enter
type moss
tap-id kb.enter
wait-for moss
clean
shot gallery-filed
tap-paged Pretend it was refused
wait-for Lichess refused this token
tap-paged Beta
wait-for New things first
# The bar menu and the row menu each open and close, and the row itself
# answers a tap.
tap Overlays
wait-for Ars Technica
tap-id bar-more
wait-for Rename
clean
shot gallery-bar-menu
tap-id menu-delete
expect-missing Rename
tap-id menu-one-more
wait-for Rename
clean
shot gallery-row-menu
tap-id row-menu-rename
expect-missing Rename
tap Ars Technica
wait-for You pressed Ars Technica.
# Ticking rows: the group ticks both, Clear unticks them, and the bar acts on
# what is ticked.
tap Lists
wait-for Lists, rows and tiles
tap Rows
tap-paged Garden birds
wait-for 2 selected
clean
shot gallery-ticked
tap Clear
expect-missing 2 selected
tap Robin
wait-for 1 selected
tap Delete
wait-for You pressed Delete.
tap-paged Update
wait-for You pressed Update.
# The icon sheets turn both ways.
tap Icons
wait-for Every icon the system draws
expect App
tap-id icons-next
expect-missing Folder
tap-id icons-back
wait-for Folder
# A row in a section pushes its own screen, whose action bar answers, and
# Back returns to the page.
tap Input
wait-for Groups, fields and asking
tap Groups
wait-for Two columns, aligned
tap-paged First
wait-for Tapping a row in a section pushes a screen.
expect Share
clean
shot gallery-pushed
tap Save
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for You pressed Save.
expect-missing Tapping a row in a section pushes a screen.
# Each state page draws its own state, and its buttons answer.
tap States
wait-for Nothing to show
tap Empty
tap Browse the catalogue
wait-for You pressed Browse the catalogue.
tap Denied
wait-for Permission needed
expect This app cannot read the library folder.
tap Error
wait-for The catalogue came back malformed.
tap Try again
wait-for You pressed Try again.
clean
shot gallery-error-state
# A tab comes back on the page it was left on.
tap Lists
wait-for Every icon the system draws
tap Panel
tap Ghosting
wait-for Ink state
expect Paper state
# A download that fails offers Resume, and resuming puts it back.
tap Transfer
wait-for Mrs Dalloway
tap Pretend it fails
wait-for Resume
clean
shot gallery-transfer-failed
tap Resume
wait-for Pretend it fails
# The content-width action on Folio opens the Ghosting page.
tap Folio
wait-for COBALT
tap Content-width action
wait-for Turn between Folio and this page
tap Folio
wait-for COBALT
# The worked download: Not now and Stop each go back a step, closing the
# book goes back to it arrived, and Back from the first step leaves the job.
tap-paged App Store
wait-for Downloading a book
tap Download it
wait-for Download Mrs Dalloway?
tap Not now
expect-missing Download Mrs Dalloway?
expect Nothing has been downloaded yet.
tap Download it
tap Download
wait-for Arriving
tap Stop
wait-for Nothing has been downloaded yet.
tap Download it
tap Download
tap Let it finish
wait-for Mrs Dalloway is on this device
tap Open it
wait-for Close the book
clean
shot gallery-reading
tap Close the book
wait-for Mrs Dalloway is on this device
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Nothing has been downloaded yet.
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Left open
expect-missing Downloading a book
# Reader details under Featured raises the Reader card's menu, so a tap on
# it shows that menu on the page it was tapped on.
tap-id panel-back
wait-for Reader details
tap Reader details
wait-for Keep reading
